  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[おぎはら/品種] 耐暑性；強\n[MBG/品種] Tolerates some light part shade in hot summer climates, but will produce weak floppy growth when grown in too much shade or in overly rich soils.\n[NC State/品種] The plant tolerates rocky and poor soils, establishes itself quickly, and is heat tolerant once established.\n[食い違い] 欧米の文献（品種の記述）は 中 相当。おぎはら植物園の値を採った\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: South-facing（西向きが入っていない）",
